# Wave W17-Y (Route 214): verge turf — meadow verge turf, lane flecks: a fresh yellow-green meadow carrying sparse pale lane flecks and the odd tiny meadow flower, the open grass between the lake and Shardfall (design: open meadow road, the crater field beginning beyond the north fence). Route 214’s own ground — split from its twin the Vernal Path by openness entire (open meadow vs the hushed lane) and from Route 210’s deep ranch pasture by appetite: this meadow is walked through, that one is grazed.
